From frew%crseo@hub.ucsb.edu Wed Aug 21 21:06:04 1991
To: ipw-list@crseo.ucsb.edu
Subject: Welcome to the IPW mailing list 
Sender: ipw-list-request%crseo@hub.ucsb.edu

As promised back in April (!), the IPW mailing list is now a reality.
The Internet address is

	ipw-list@crseo.ucsb.edu

Any e-mail sent to this address will be automatically re-sent to all of
the list's subscribers.

If you received this mail then you are already subscriber, either
because you asked to be, or because you sent me email about IPW long
ago in a network far far away.

If you want to be deleted from the list, or if you know of someone
who'd like to be added to the list, send mail containing your request
to:

	ipw-list-request@crseo.ucsb.edu

Note the "-request" suffix!  Mail sent to ipw-list-request is read by
the maintainer of ipw-list (currently == me), but is NOT redistributed
to the ipw-list subscribers.

I am new at the mailing-list business so things may be a little rusty
at first -- please bear with me.

-Frew

